# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Imveliso bhala: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: ([''] tccompare: ['']), umgca-omtsha.
